# Griff 30 - all-electric heavy-lift quadcopter (4 arms, 4 motors).
# Flight dynamics are a stock X quad; the Griff-specific behaviour is the B100
# payload/power module, simulated by Tools/autotest/griff_b100_sim.py.
# FRAME_CLASS 1 (Quad) comes from copter.parm; FRAME_TYPE 1 selects X.
FRAME_TYPE      1
# SERIAL5 carries the B100 link, as UART7 does on the real aircraft.
SERIAL5_PROTOCOL 2
